Package: DitchmapR
Title: Visualize the 5-D Itch Scale Body-Region Distribution
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Marsuki", "Hardjo", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Validate binary itch-region data and create reproducible plots
    of region-specific itch prevalence across 16 distribution choices, including a
    schematic front/back anatomical visualization. This
    package is an independent visualization utility and does not replace
    validated scoring or the original questionnaire.
